### Stray dependency source/class dumps at the repo root ###
# This project's Java lives under src/ only. A top-level io/ or org/ tree is an
# accidental sources-jar unzip or IDE decompile dump of a dependency, never
# anything this repo authors, so keep it from being swept back in by a broad
# `git add`.
/io/
/org/
